Azure Advisor is a personalized recommendation service that analyzes Azure environments and provides guidance for improving resources. It can help organizations identify opportunities related to cost, security, reliability, performance, and operational efficiency.

Advisor recommendations can highlight:

* Underutilized resources
* Security improvement opportunities
* Reliability improvements
* Performance optimization
* Cost-saving opportunities

For example, Advisor may identify an underutilized virtual machine and recommend considering a smaller size to reduce unnecessary expenditure.

A real-life use case is a cloud operations team reviewing Advisor recommendations during a monthly optimization exercise.

Azure Advisor helps administrators make informed improvements without having to manually inspect every resource configuration.
